Endpoint catalog: every API endpoint and the policy rule that guards it.

Student notes:
- policy.csv speaks in (resource, action) pairs; people think in endpoints
  ("POST /api/admin/products"). This list connects the two, so Swagger (/docs) can show
  each role only the endpoints it may call.
- access:
    "public"     -> no token needed
    "logged_in"  -> any valid token, every role
    "policy"     -> decided by policy.csv through (resource, action)
- Routes that are not in this list (the /demo routes) are shown to admins only.
- tests/test_api_docs.py checks this list against the real routes, so a new endpoint
  can't be forgotten here.
"""

